      "source": ["# SpendSmart Research Pipeline (Colab)\n", "This notebook reproduces the full research‑grade pipeline on Google Colab. It installs dependencies, loads a privacy‑safe demo dataset, runs ingestion, feature engineering, model training, evaluation, and generates the required tables/figures.\n"]
